+# Plan — resize the stats card when the rank is hidden
+
+## 1. Tests
+
+- [ ] 1.1 A card rendered with hide_rank is as wide as its default title plus the padding (tests/renderStatsCard.test.js) [AC-1]
+- [ ] 1.2 A card rendered with hide_rank and a short custom title keeps the 270 px minimum (tests/renderStatsCard.test.js) [AC-2]
+
+## 2. The card
+
+- [ ] 2.1 Add `measureText` to the shared utils (src/common/utils.js)
+- [ ] 2.2 Compute the stats card width from the title when hide_rank is set (src/cards/stats-card.js)
+- [ ] 2.3 Note the resize in the hide_rank option docs (readme.md)
